================================================================================
Provenance and third-party components
================================================================================

cmd/, rvgo/, rvsol/, tests/
    Derived from https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/asterisc, MIT licensed,
    copyright (c) 2023 @protolambda, transferred to the Optimism organisation in
    2024. The RISC-V interpreter, merkleized memory, bisection tooling and the
    Solidity mirror originate there.

    MLVM's additions to that base, also MIT and covered by the copyright above:
      rvgo/comp/          RV32/64 F and D via Berkeley SoftFloat
      rvgo/include/       SoftFloat support types
      rvgo/riscv/         RISC-V NaN specialisation
      rvgo/fast/file.go   in-memory file system
      rvgo/fast/trace.go  diagnostic tracing
      floating-point decoding, syscall surface and instruction profiling in
      rvgo/fast/vm.go, and the tests and benchmarks in rvgo/test/

rvgo/comp, include, riscv
    A hand port to Go of Berkeley SoftFloat Release 3e by John R. Hauser,
    http://www.jhauser.us/arithmetic/SoftFloat.html, derived from softfloat-go
    (https://github.com/yao-jz/softfloat-go, MIT).
    Copyright (c) 2011-2018 The Regents of the University of California.
    Distributed under a 3-clause BSD-style license; see the upstream
    COPYING.txt. The port preserves the original algorithms and structure.

tests/riscv-tests/
    Test vectors generated from
    https://github.com/riscv-software-src/riscv-tests, distributed under the
    license in tests/riscv-tests/LICENSE.

rvsol/lib/         (git submodules, not distributed here)
    forge-std   MIT / Apache-2.0, https://github.com/foundry-rs/forge-std
    optimism    MIT,              https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism

third_party/                (git submodules, not distributed here)
    candle      MIT / Apache-2.0, https://github.com/huggingface/candle
    MLinRust    see its own README, https://github.com/Raibows/MLinRust

Model checkpoints downloaded by scripts/model-bench.sh are not distributed with
this repository and remain under their own licenses on the Hugging Face Hub.
